WEBVTT

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:13.180
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:12.820
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.880
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.290
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:27.400
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.540
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:37.100
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:41.290
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.360
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.450
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:58.210
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.490
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:05.420
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.870
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:25.180
Takara Fansubs

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:30.700
<i>Around the time of the wedding of the Grand Duke of Milan,</i>

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:34.600
<i>...a girl stepped into Romeo's life.</i>

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:40.200
<i>That girl was none other than Alfredo's sister, Bianca.</i>

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:49.240
<i>Their Uncle Mauricio's and Aunt Grazela's schemes had engulfed them in tragedy.</i>

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:55.260
Episode 25:

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:55.260
Alfredo and Bianca Reunited

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:04.650
I told you you'd never get away.

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:06.980
Stay away! Murderer!

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:11.750
Bianca!

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:18.380
You... You're the beast who killed my mother and father!

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:24.530
What a dreadful thing for someone with such a pretty face to...

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:34.560
Tough break, Bianca.
Do you hate me that much?

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.660
Let me go!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:41.940
Let me go!

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:45.380
Let me go!
- Be quiet!

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.460
That girl...

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.360
Help!

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:53.620
Big brother, help! Alfredo!

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:55.630
Alfredo!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:57.990
Go!

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:04.820
Alfredo...? "Big brother"...??

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.410
Alfredo!

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:11.480
Nikita...
- Someone just took a girl away.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:16.720
She yelled out, "Help! Alfredo!"
- It's Bianca.

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:20.120
Hey! What's going on?

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.580
Welcome back, Mr. Martini.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:30.370
Is something the matter with Miss Bianca?

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:34.340
She was feeling a little ill.
Nothing to worry about.

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:38.280
Bianca!
- What's with you two?

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.990
My sister is inside.

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:42.840
Please let us in.
- No way.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:44.830
Romeo!

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:47.820
I'm all right.
- What'd you do that for?!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:52.920
This hotel has important people staying as guests.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:57.040
This is no place for you.
Now get going!

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.900
Wait, Romeo.
- But... Alfredo!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.620
Anyway, let's go.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.630
<i>Bianca, I promise I'll come to save you. Just wait.</i>

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:11.520
You're one tough nut to crack.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.880
A real wild kitty!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:18.860
Hmph. So, ran away to meet beloved big brother, eh?

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:27.590
We already know he's in town...
with our "treasure".

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:31.110
Alfredo would never hand it over to you two!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.190
Shut up!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:41.580
What a smart-aleck. I'll fix you so you can never show your face to Alfredo again.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:49.340
Mauricio and Grazela want to get their hands on ME.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:52.690
I'VE got what they want.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:54.190
What they want?

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:02.900
It was entrusted to me by my father, before he died.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.570
Alfredo! It's the Martini household's heirloom.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:12.710
So long as you have that treasure, my pride and honor will be yours.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.060
A medal. That's a medal, right?

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.840
A "medal"?
- What's that?

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:31.800
It was given to my father by Carlo Alberto, King of Sardinia.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.400
Carlo Alberto?

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:37.590
Who's that?
- The father of the King of Italy.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.460
The King's father?!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:49.580
A real KING gave that medal to your father?

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:57.300
They'll need to get their hands on this medal before the banquet.

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:58.510
Why?

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:03.120
A banquet is being held next week for the Grand Prince's wedding....

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:09.290
Well, nobility and royalty from Italy and elsewhere has been invited...

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.690
...among them, Mauricio and Grazela.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:17.400
But there's one thing they need if they're going to meet the King.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.990
One thing?

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:22.380
This medal, to prove they're part of the Martini line.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.380
<i>Big brother, help me!</i>

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:30.980
Hold on, Grazela...

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:36.490
Bianca's a valuable hostage.
- I can't wait!

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:42.460
Without that medal, we'll look like fools in front of the King of Italy.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.200
No doubt about that.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.190
We're almost out of time! How are we going to get it?

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:51.960
We've managed to get everything else we wanted so far.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:56.480
I'll get it, no matter what I have to do.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:02.980
Alfredo will come here to rescue Bianca...

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.710
And he'll fall into our trap.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:11.860
His love for his sister will prove his downfall.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:22.380
I'll do whatever it takes to rescue Bianca.

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:24.410
I'm going to save Bianca.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.120
I'm coming with you.
- Romeo.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:31.150
Me too.
- Me too.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.180
Me too.
- Me too.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.240
Me too.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.190
Me too.
- Us too, naturally!

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:38.710
And me too!

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.810
We'll do anything for you, Alfredo.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:44.180
Just give the word.
- Thank you.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:47.150
But this is a personal matter.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:50.640
And therefore I have to take care of it myself.

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.410
No way.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:54.340
That's exactly what they're hoping you'll do.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.780
If you mess up once, you'll lose your chance to save Bianca.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:03.200
Those two are meaner than you all know.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.840
I'm risking my own life as it is...

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.220
I can't drag you guys into it.

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:11.220
The Black Brothers help each other out.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:16.180
If any one of us suffers, we all suffer. If one of us is happy, we're all happy.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:21.210
We shall overcome all hardships by working together.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:25.090
Let's be there for each other!
- For each other!

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:28.130
Let's always be together!
- Together!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.320
Thanks, everybody.

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:47.680
But as I said before, they're not to be taken lightly.

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.510
Watch yourselves.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:52.310
All right then, let's think up a plan!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.520
Hello. I'm from the fruit shop.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.650
I've got a delivery here for a Mr. Martini.

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:06.700
Fruit shop? I've never seen you before.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.380
Which fruit shop?

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.270
Which... fruit shop...?

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:13.050
Well, um... It's a new one called "The Chimney".

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.670
The Chimney...
- Hey!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:19.530
Where are you going?
- Uh-oh! Run!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.040
Run!
- You! Stop!

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:27.020
Operation 1, complete success.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.420
Is that the room?
- That's it.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.190
<i>Alfredo, we'll get Bianca out no matter what.</i>

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:41.130
All right, time for Phase 2.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.370
Trouble. There's somebody in there.
- Now, of all times!

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:57.330
Come here a minute!

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:58.740
What's up?

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:01.870
A bunch of kids are making a ruckus in the lobby.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:04.580
A bunch of kids? What's going on?

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:09.960
Hey you! Stop!

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:12.670
Anyhow, let's go see.

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:17.920
Great! They're doing it just as planned. 
- Hey!

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:21.970
What are you doing here?
- Uh-oh!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.890
Stop, you!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.180
Heey!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:32.140
We're over here!
- You go after them.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:35.110
I'll go after this one.
- Got it!

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:39.430
Where'd you go...?

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.400
Ah, here we go.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:48.160
Now... where'd you go...

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:57.150
I'm in home territory in here.

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:59.820
This ought to lead to Bianca's room.

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:16.730
I found you!

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:18.290
You're...

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:24.460
I never got the chance to introduce myself earlier. I'm Romeo, a friend of Alfredo.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:27.000
A friend of Alfredo?

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:31.180
I'm here to rescue you.
We've got to get out of here fast.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:34.800
Where's Alfredo now?

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.720
He's waiting in San Babila church.

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:42.760
<i>Dear God, please protect everyone.</i>

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:46.240
And don't worry, he's got the medal with him.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.720
The Martini household's medal?
- Yes.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:54.460
Did you hear that, Grazela?
- Oh, yes.

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.680
It seems the boy is in San Babila church.

00:11:57.680 --> 00:12:03.410
AND he has the medal with him.
- My thanks, Romeo.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:29.750
We're finally going to get our hands on that medal.

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:33.870
Now we'll have the Martini's stature.

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:38.810
Alfredo would never hand over that medal to Mauricio.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.980
True. If he was alive.

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:44.210
What are you going to do to Alfredo?!

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:49.080
Mauricio is the fastest gun in Piedmont.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:08.940
San Babila church. Hurry!

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:34.880
Who are they?
- The Black Brothers. Alfredo's buddies.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.040
Alfredo's buddies?
- Yes.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.450
Hi! I'm Dante.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.800
Michaelo.

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:48.880
Antonio. You'll see Alfredo in no time.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:59.020
Who are you!?
- The Black Brothers!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.840
That's priceless.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.330
Makes you look prettier than that makeup does.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:19.890
Lady, what're you saying?

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:25.510
Everyone hurry to the church. Alfredo's in danger.

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:32.610
They're late coming...
I wonder why?

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:35.080
Maybe something went wrong.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.770
I knew it would. I should have gone.

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:50.900
No. I know they'll come through and save her.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.480
Not yet.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.970
Not at such an important time.
Snap out of it.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:23.570
I'll be meeting Bianca soon.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:35.470
<i>I've finally found you, Alfredo.</i>

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:50.110
Michaelo, take Bianca to the secret hideout.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:52.600
You two come with me.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:55.200
Right!
- Wait. I want to come too.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:59.040
No. It's too dangerous for you.
- But...

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:02.580
We'll bring Alfredo back. Just wait.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.860
Let's go!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.030
I'm... going anyway!

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.690
Bianca!

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:21.850
Mauricio!

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:25.220
Long time, Alfredo.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.040
You've been having a rough time of it, I hear.

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:30.110
Why, you murderer...!
- Don't move!

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:35.620
You better not have hurt Bianca.
- She's fine.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:38.360
But she's been quite the troublemaker.

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:44.290
I'll get rid of that kitten and you as soon as I've got what I want.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:45.790
You inhuman...!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:57.800
Okay, enough games.
Hand over the Martini medal!

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.240
Not on your life!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:04.680
Where's the medal?
Tell me, or else...

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:12.480
<i>Alfredo, please be okay.</i>

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:19.580
Huh? There's a festival today?
- No, no...

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:22.260
They're waiting to see the royal procession.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:28.190
Oh, so we can't pass. What now?
- We'll have to take a detour.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.880
Romeo!
- Bianca!

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:36.040
Sorry. She just wouldn't listen.
- Romeo, please let me come.

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:38.110
But...
- Please.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:42.060
All right. Let's rescue Alfredo together.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:45.190
Where's the medal, Alfredo?

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:55.590
Damn!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:10.670
The King's carriage will pass by here soon!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:22.390
Hey!
- What's your problem, Pop?!

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:32.620
Hey, Alfredo.
- Nikita.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:36.390
I saw what happened.
What a nasty guy.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:38.330
Let me get rid of him for you.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:45.540
Boy, that kid was in a hurry, like he was running from somebody.

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:52.080
Kind of cute, though... Blonde, blue eyes... Age: 12 or 13.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:54.530
Which way did he go?

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.590
That way. He's long gone now.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.050
<i>That's the King's father.</i>

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:32.240
<i>He's the one who gave the medal to my father.</i>

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:39.250
<i>He might understand...</i>

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:44.740
<i>...If I present myself to him wearing the Martini medal.</i>

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:51.160
<i>That's it! I'll tell the King the truth...</i>

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:54.680
<i>...about those responsible for the death of my mother and father.</i>

00:19:55.280 --> 00:20:00.370
<i>...and who put the blame on Bianca and I.</i>

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:04.820
<i>I'll tell the King the truth.</i>

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.560
Alfredo!

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:15.930
Romeo.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:19.830
Thank goodness you're okay.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:25.210
The plan was a complete success. Have a look.

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:31.380
Alfredo.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:33.450
Bianca.

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:41.480
Alfredo.
- Bianca.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:45.710
Alfredo!
- Bianca!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:57.280
I missed you... I always thought about you, big brother.

00:20:57.390 --> 00:21:01.730
So did I, Bianca. I'll never leave you alone again.

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:14.250
No matter what, I'll...

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:17.010
Big brother?

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:20.510
Protect you...

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.020
What is it, big brother?

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:29.310
Big brother?

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:30.830
Alfredo!

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:33.050
What's wrong? Alfredo!

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:35.790
Snap out of it, Alfredo!

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:37.150
Big brother!

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:45.310
Alfredo!

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:59.680
<i>The day of the banquet was approaching.</i>

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:01.710
<i>Mauricio, eyeing the Martini fortune,</i>

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:05.350
<i>...had a fake medal made so that he could meet the King.</i>

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:08.760
<i>I won't let that scoundrel get away with it.</i>

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:13.430
See you then!

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:13.430
<i>Proud Souls</i>

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:13.430
Next time:

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:18.800
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:31.510
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:31.610 --> 00:22:35.810
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:36.010 --> 00:22:40.010
<i>Si Si Ciao, we're all friends</i>

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:44.210
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:49.120
<i>Your laughing voice dances</i>

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:53.020
<i>Once again in the sky</i>

00:22:53.420 --> 00:23:00.320
<i>Your pocket bursting with memories</i>

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:05.920
<i>Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now</i>

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:10.120
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>
